WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
The generative grid starts from a repeatable seed and palette.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Density and palette controls change the composition.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
A new variation changes the seeded pattern.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
The current composition can be downloaded as SVG.
